    {
      "speaker": "ルカ",
      "text": "……チッ、また半拍遅れてる。そんな緩い入り方じゃ、本番で置いてかれるぞ",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "luca",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "026",
      "clothId": "026",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "anger1",
      "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
      "lip": "lip_anger",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_01",
        "zh": "……啧，又慢了半拍。用这么松懈的方式切入，正式登台会被甩在后面的。",
        "speakerZh": "斑鸠路加",
        "surfaceEmotion": "anger_pout",
        "innerEmotion": "shy_defensive",
        "vocalTone": "crisp_clipped",
        "note": "开场 BGM 006 紧张鼓点，路加严厉打断",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "节奏分歧的火药味"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "ご、ごめんなさい、ルカちゃん……。サビ前の息継ぎ、まだ掴めなくて……",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "sad1",
      "charAnim2": "face_close",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
      "lip": "lip_sad",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_02",
        "zh": "对、对不起，路加……。副歌前的换气点，我还是没抓稳……",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "sad_downcast",
        "innerEmotion": "anxious_fragile",
        "vocalTone": "hushed_fragile",
        "note": "羽那低头致歉",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "节奏分歧的火药味"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "はるき",
      "text": "待って、ルカちゃん。……今のところ、伴奏の音量を少し絞って確かめてみませんか？",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "haruki",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "028",
      "clothId": "028",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait1",
      "charAnim2": "face_serious",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_03",
        "zh": "等一下，路加。……刚才那一段，要不要先把伴奏音量调小一些确认看看？",
        "speakerZh": "郁田阳希",
        "surfaceEmotion": "calm_neutral",
        "innerEmotion": "resolve_quiet",
        "vocalTone": "calm_even",
        "note": "阳希冷静提出调整方案",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "节奏分歧的火药味"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ルカ",
      "text": "……好きにしろ。どうせ、聴こえてなきゃ意味がねえんだろ",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "luca",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "026",
      "clothId": "026",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_serious",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_04",
        "zh": "……随你便吧。反正听不见彼此的声音就毫无意义了吧。",
        "speakerZh": "斑鸠路加",
        "surfaceEmotion": "calm_neutral",
        "innerEmotion": "resolve_quiet",
        "vocalTone": "calm_even",
        "note": "BGM 在句中切换为温柔抒情 002，气氛缓和",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "停拍与重新倾听"
      },
      "bgm": "002"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "はるき",
      "text": "ありがとうございます。……ほら、羽那ちゃん。ルカちゃんの靴音に合わせて息を吸ってみて",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "haruki",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "028",
      "clothId": "028",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_05",
        "zh": "谢谢你。……你看，羽那。试着顺着路加的脚步声节奏来吸气。",
        "speakerZh": "郁田阳希",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "阳希引导羽那倾听呼吸与脚步",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "停拍与重新倾听"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "……あっ！ 本当だ、ルカちゃんのテンポと重なる場所が見えてきました！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_06",
        "zh": "……啊！真的，我看见能和路加的节拍重合的位置了！",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "smile_gentle",
        "innerEmotion": "performative_sweet",
        "vocalTone": "sweet_performative",
        "note": "羽那眼神亮起，找准合拍点",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "停拍与重新倾听"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "はるき",
      "text": "三人の影が、窓の夕焼けで同じ向きに伸びてますね。……今なら、いけそうです",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "haruki",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "028",
      "clothId": "028",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_07",
        "zh": "三个人的影子，都被窗外的晚霞拉向同一个方向呢。……如果是现在的话，一定没问题。",
        "speakerZh": "郁田阳希",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "阳希望向落日余晖",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "晚霞中的共鸣",
        "x-beatBgmAuto": "017",
        "x-bgmReason": "剧情转向「感动抒情」，自动切换「感伤抒情·放課後CLIMAXGIRLS配乐 (BGM 017)」"
      },
      "bgm": "017"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ルカ",
      "text": "……悪くねえな。次でもう一度、最初から合わせんぞ",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "luca",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "026",
      "clothId": "026",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_close",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
      "lip": "lip_sad",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s3_08",
        "zh": "……倒也不坏。下一遍再从头合一次吧。",
        "speakerZh": "斑鸠路加",
        "surfaceEmotion": "troubled_sigh",
        "innerEmotion": "guarded_distance",
        "vocalTone": "sigh_trail",
        "note": "路加轻叹一口气，检验 sigh/lip_s 修复效果并收尾",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "晚霞中的共鸣"
      }
    },
